# Dataset Pivot (Active)

> **Locked decisions:** `docs/PIVOT_PLAN.md` § Locked decisions. **Product vision:** `docs/DATASET_PLATFORM.md`.

## What we're building

**Dataset intelligence platform** (BeatPulse-style): upload files + schema template → labeled JSONL + QC out.

NOT research/RAG. Do not add Tavily, pgvector, web search, or markdown synthesis.

## Target pipeline (LocalStack + workers)

```
project.submitted → intake.completed → preprocessing.completed → planning.completed
  → annotation.task.dispatched (×N) → annotation.task.completed (×N) → export.completed
```

| Stage           | Worker                      | Notes                                                       |
| --------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| Intake          | Register files (local disk) | `./data/uploads/{project_id}/`                              |
| Preprocessing   | Extract + segment           | **Sequential** v1 (all assets in one worker)                |
| Planning        | Template + batch → tasks    | 2 templates: support-call, document-classification          |
| Annotation (×N) | LLM label batches           | **Map fan-out**; sequential fallback if LocalStack SF flaky |
| Export          | JSONL + QC report           | Coverage, compliance, confidence flags                      |

## Schema UX

- Template picker + optional JSON override
- Templates: **Support call annotation**, **Document classification**
- Demo fixture: `fixtures/support-calls/*.txt`

## Terminology (new code)

Job→Project, Source→Asset, DocumentChunk→Segment, KnowledgeEntity→AnnotationTask, ResearchNote→AnnotationBatch, SynthesisReport→DatasetExport

Stage IDs: `intake`, `preprocessing`, `planning`, `annotation`, `export`

## Keep

LocalStack (EventBridge, SQS, Step Functions), workers, idempotency, DLQ, SSE, React Flow, OTEL, cost tracking

## Remove / do not add

pgvector, Tavily, RAG, `/queries` route, AWS deploy work, Terraform maintenance, S3 (v1)

## Migration

Big-bang with vertical slices. No parallel old+new API. Delete research code as each stage is replaced.

## Demo UX

60% React Flow pipeline / 40% QC panel + JSONL download

